- **Internal (from dependency tasks)**:
  - internal/cli/concurrency.go (ConcurrencyTracker) — from cjml5.7
  - internal/cli/task_router.go (MergeRoleConstraints, SelectBestTask, RoleConstraints) — from cjml5.6
